      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Stepwise diagram along a horizontal arrow showing increasing levels of STI services: 'No STI services'; 'Syndromic management only (no tests available)'; 'Syndromic management + Testing using RDTs and treatment'; and 'Syndromic management + RDTs and molecular testing, treatment + Vaccination'.",
